pool.md §13: each phase of the pool is tested before it's switched on, and an Opus agent reviews its code and docs before merging.

The tests go in steps:
1. the in-process harness (two members, fake clocks);
2. both Macs on a scratch state;
3. the live switch.

Phases 1–2 had their review, fixes and a shadow run before going on (2008 keys the same, 0 different; switched on 8 Oct). Still to come: phase 3 (#20, under way) and phase 4 (#21). Phase 3's real handover can only be tried on the live pool, once the terrain rebuild ends.
